00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:59.000
desperately trying to plug up gopher holes and reinforce the levee. Jose points down the river to the site of one of his more memorable battles. It was kind of scary, and that particular night, we were told just to get away from here, that the river's going so high. In the middle of the night,

