Jose and a couple of friends headed down to the levee to see the angry river for themselves. So we started walking from the bridge all the way out here, okay, midnight. Three idiots walking the levee. So by the time we got over here, it was like we met the sheriff at that time. We told him, he says, well, what do you think? He says, we can stop it here. All through the windy night,

