I took a trip to the newest state park in California. It's called Dos Rios, and it's the site of one of the largest floodplain restoration projects in the state. Welcome to the next California State Park. Yeah. Let's check it out. Yep. My guide for the day is Austin Stevenot, a field manager with the organization River Partners and a member of the Northern Sierra Miwok Tribe.

